@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Development & Setup Tools\nLocal Environment

top to bottom direction

actor "Developer" as Dev #DBEAFE

database "PostgreSQL\nlocalhost:5432" as DB #F3E8FF

rectangle "npm run start:dev\nNestJS hot-reload server\n:3000" as BackendDev #CCFBF1
rectangle "npm run dev\nVite frontend dev server\n:5173" as FrontendDev #DBEAFE
rectangle "npx prisma migrate dev\nApply schema migrations\n(3 migration files)" as Migrate #FEF9C3
rectangle "npx prisma db seed\nCreate 8 demo accounts\n+ sample clinical data" as Seed #FEF9C3
rectangle "npx prisma studio\nGUI to browse / edit data\n:5555" as Studio #F1F5F9
rectangle "npm run test:e2e\nRun 104 E2E tests\n(Phase 1 coverage)" as Tests #DCFCE7
rectangle "npm run lint / build\nESLint + TypeScript check" as Lint #F1F5F9

Dev --> BackendDev : start backend
Dev --> FrontendDev : start frontend
Dev --> Migrate : setup database schema
Dev --> Seed : populate demo data
Dev --> Studio : inspect data
Dev --> Tests : run E2E tests
Dev --> Lint : quality check

Migrate --> DB : apply migrations
Seed --> DB : insert demo records
Studio --> DB : read / write GUI

note right of Seed
Demo accounts seeded:
admin / doctor / receptionist
cashier / manager / nurse
labtech / pharmacist
Password pattern: Role@123456
end note

note bottom of Tests
Not available in current setup:
- Docker / docker-compose
- CI/CD pipeline
- HTTPS certificate
- Production environment
end note

@enduml
